        "gate": "exact_local_block_exponential",
        "operation": "parallel_local_exponentials",
        "targets": [
          "onsite blocks s=0,1,2,3,4"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "step_symbol": "N_T",
    "symmetry_preservation_rule": "For z_index!=0 require positive integer N_T. Every onsite and link block commutes with Q_qc, so each completed local exponential and every finite-N_T product preserve the mandatory Q_qc=0 and Q_qc=-1 sectors and fermion parity exactly. No gauge sector exists. The even/odd ordering can break spatial reflection and antiunitary lattice symmetries at finite N_T; compare their diagnostics across increasing N_T and require convergence. Broken translations and continuum-only Lorentz boosts are not imposed. For z_index=0 accept trotter_steps=0 and build no evolution."
  }
